<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-6053] IgniteCache.clear clears local caches with same names on all server nodes</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-6053</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Clear on LOCAL cache should clear cache on the current node only, not on all nodes, that have local caches with same names.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
